{"3847110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "One More Delve", "steam_appid": 3847110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One More Delve is a physics-based VR dungeon crawler. Fight, loot, and survive in up to 3 player co-op as you delve into randomized dungeons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in realistic melee combat where every slash, parry, and block matters. Feel the true weight of your weapons as you dismember your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/02043159ace9421202adab44f9102c76.poster.avif?t=1787579025\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/02043159ace9421202adab44f9102c76.webm?t=1787579025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/02043159ace9421202adab44f9102c76.mp4?t=1787579025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/c5a998a26a85e20318f319e4e464f57f.poster.avif?t=1787579025\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/c5a998a26a85e20318f319e4e464f57f.webm?t=1787579025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/c5a998a26a85e20318f319e4e464f57f.mp4?t=1787579025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Character</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot new armor and weapons to configure your own playstyle. Choose from one- and two-handed swords, axes, bows, shields and spells to help you fight and explore your way towards the final boss of the dungeon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/39a9c6936c75933def413474cfaf814e.poster.avif?t=1787579025\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/39a9c6936c75933def413474cfaf814e.webm?t=1787579025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/39a9c6936c75933def413474cfaf814e.mp4?t=1787579025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/2173fc110ae1625ecd5153858437f264.poster.avif?t=1787579025\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/2173fc110ae1625ecd5153858437f264.webm?t=1787579025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/2173fc110ae1625ecd5153858437f264.mp4?t=1787579025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Hub Server</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between dungeon runs, relax in the social hub, interact with other players and use the materials you've gathered to craft new weapons and armor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/e047acec1e0f5c3897c5b5fc0c44f333.poster.avif?t=1787579025\" width=600 height=338 